# Magus Tirth's Ancona Chicken at the Mirage Raceway.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor); Forever client 1.60.1.70338 via
# wago.tools (ItemSparse prices; every pet item teaches its companion when
# used).

step Magus Tirth
  tip Magus Tirth at the Mirage Raceway, in the Shimmering Flats of south-eastern Thousand Needles, sells the Ancona Chicken (1g). Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 6548                         -- Magus Tirth
  buy 11023 npc 6548 optional         -- Ancona Chicken, 1g
